IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WEB-EXTENSIONS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 COOKIE-COUNT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 CACHE-HIT-RATIO     PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SSE-EVENTS-COUNT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 WEB-SPEEDUP-FACTOR  PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-WEB-EXTENSIONS.
    IF COOKIE-COUNT == 0 OR SSE-EVENTS-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-STATE.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 4500 TO WEB-SPEEDUP-FACTOR.
    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 COOKIE-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 CACHE-HIT-RATIO.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 12.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-STATE.
    MOVE 0 TO WEB-SPEEDUP-FACTOR.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
